    <string name="help_title">FRETBOARD EXPLORER — QUICK GUIDE</string>
    <string name="help_sec1_title">1. THREE EXPLORATION MODES</string>
    <string name="help_sec1_body">Switch between 1: Scales (16 scales + 5 CAGED boxes), 2: Chords (12 chord qualities with movable CAGED voicings), and 3: Chord Finder (tap any fret to lock/mute strings and identify custom chords).</string>
    <string name="help_sec2_title">2. AUDIO SYNTHESIS &amp; STRUMMING</string>
    <string name="help_sec2_body">Tap any fret on the 6-string neck to pluck a Karplus-Strong guitar note, or tap ▶ in the top bar to strum the active chord or audition the scale.</string>
    <string name="help_sec3_title">3. HARMONIC COLOR LEGEND</string>
    <string name="help_sec3_body">Root = Amber-Red | 3rd (3/b3) = Emerald Green | 5th = Royal Blue | 7th (7/b7) = Purple | Blue Note (b5) = Gold | Scale Tone = Slate.</string>
    <string name="help_sec4_title">4. LABELS, TUNINGS &amp; LEFTY MODE</string>
    <string name="help_sec4_body">Cycle fret markers between Intervals (R, 3, 5), Note Names, and Scale Degrees, switch across 6 guitar tunings (Standard, Drop D, DADGAD, Eb, Open G, Open D), or flip for left-handed players.</string>
    <string name="help_sec5_title">5. FRETBOARD MASTERY QUIZ</string>
    <string name="help_sec5_body">Toggle Note Quiz or Interval Quiz to test your fretboard recall across all 6 strings with live score tracking.</string>
